[hp3_adv1express]
Line0=Move with the arrow keys or the A, W, S and D keys.
Picture0=Picture_00
Count=1
[hp3_adv2exppatronum]
Line0=When several Dementors attack Harry at once, remember that they can come at him from behind. Turn your character around often and be ready to cast a spell at any moment.
Picture0=Picture_01
Count=1
[hp3_adv3library]
Line0=To skip a cutscene, press ENTER. Tutorial cutscenes cannot be skipped.
Picture0=Picture_02
Count=1
[hp3_adv5shack]
Line0=When fighting the imps, move your hero forward and back to dodge their exploding crackers. Press A and D to take a step to the side.
Picture0=Picture_03
Count=1
[hp3_adv6paddock]
Line0=Look for hidden prizes, and remember that only the spell challenges can be played several times.
Picture0=Picture_04
Count=1
[hp3_beanbonus]
Line0=The prizes you collect in the bonus room can be spent at Fred and George's shop.
Picture0=Picture_05
Count=1
[hp3_buckyexecuted]
Line0=Press Esc from time to time to look at your task list. To win the game you must complete everything on it.
Picture0=Picture_06
Count=1
[hp3_ch1carperetractum]
Line0=Press A and D to step to the side, and W and S to move forward and back. Move the mouse to turn and aim. The left mouse button casts spells and the right one jumps.
Picture0=Picture_07
Count=1
[HP3_Ch1CarpeRetractumB]
Line0=Collect as many beans, pumpkin pasties and cauldron cakes as you can: they will come in very handy at Fred and George's shop.
Picture0=Picture_05
Count=1
[hp3_ch2draconifors]
Line0=You can steer the magic rabbits with the mouse. Press the right button to make the rabbit jump, and move the mouse to turn it. Move the rabbit with the arrow keys.
Picture0=Picture_08_B
Line1=Some prizes can only be reached with the magic rabbits and the little dragons.
Picture1=Picture_08_A
Count=2
[HP3_Ch2DraconiforsB]
Line0=Collect as many beans, pumpkin pasties and cauldron cakes as you can: they will come in very handy at Fred and George's shop.
Picture0=Picture_08_A
Count=1
[hp3_ch3glacius]
Line0=Amazon salamanders give off sparks. If you do not put them out in time, a new salamander is born from the flames.
Picture0=Picture_09
Count=1
[HP3_Ch3GlaciusB]
Line0=Collect as many beans, pumpkin pasties and cauldron cakes as you can: they will come in very handy at Fred and George's shop.
Picture0=Picture_08_A
Count=1
[hp3_comc]
Line0=You can steer the little dragons and Buckbeak with the mouse. Press the right mouse button to make the creature flap its wings. Move the mouse to change direction.
Picture0=Picture_10
Count=1
[hp3_darktower]
Line0=You can visit the hippogriff paddock whenever you like. There are five courses to fly to earn a full set of collector cards.
Picture0=Picture_19_A
Count=1
[hp3_dementorbattle]
Line0=To cast "Expecto Patronum", hold down the left mouse button until the ring of light is more than halfway along the wand.
Picture0=Picture_12_B
Line1=If several Dementors attack you at once, the mouse may be easier to use. Move it to turn, and use the left button to pick a target and cast the spell.
Picture1=Picture_12
Count=2
[hp3_dungeonhub]
Line0=Some of Hogwarts' secrets can only be opened up together with friends. In those cases Harry, Ron and Hermione must all use magic.
Picture0=Picture_13
Count=1
[HP3_FA1Ron]
Line0=Spell challenges can be replayed at any time, but story missions and the final exams must be started again from the load menu.
Picture0=Picture_14
Count=1
[hp3_fa2hermione]
Line0=Experiment a lot when you control the little dragon. Remember: it may be asked to do more than just fly!
Picture0=Picture_15
Count=1
[hp3_fa3harry]
Line0=If several enemies attack you at once, a character who can dodge attacks has a much better chance of winning. The easiest way is to move forward and back. You can also step to the side with A and D.
Picture0=Picture_16
Count=1
[hp3_final]
Line0=Congratulations! You have successfully finished your third year!
Picture0=Picture_17
Count=1
[hp3_groundsdada]
Line0=The school and its grounds hold many secrets. See something unusual? Use magic!
Picture0=Picture_18
Count=1
[hp3_groundshub]
Line0=At Fred and George's shop you can trade Bertie Bott's Beans for pumpkin pasties and cauldron cakes (if they are in stock). The reason is that some especially valuable cards and portrait passwords cannot be bought with beans.
Picture0=Picture_19_B
Line1=To finish the game you must complete every task on the list. To see it, press Esc, then click the check mark icon on the right of the screen.
Picture1=Picture_19_C
Line2=Some of Hogwarts' secrets can only be opened up together with friends. In those cases Harry, Ron and Hermione must all use magic.
Picture2=Picture_19_D
Line3=Collect as many beans, pumpkin pasties and cauldron cakes as you can: they will come in very handy at Fred and George's shop.
Picture3=Picture_08_A
Line4=You can visit the hippogriff paddock whenever you like. There are five courses to fly to earn a full set of collector cards.
Picture4=Picture_19_A
Count=5
[hp3_infirmary]
Line0=Press Esc from time to time to look at your task list. To win the game you must complete everything on it.
Picture0=Picture_20
Count=1
[hp3_insidehub]
Line0=Press TAB to see the Marauder's Map. It shows a plan of the school and its grounds, and your character's position is marked with footprints.
Picture0=Picture_21_C
Line1=The portraits let you go to any floor of the castle at once. They hang in a side room next to the school entrance.
Picture1=Picture_21_A
Line2=You can meet other students in the school and its grounds. They can often give useful advice, remind you of something important, or even tell you one of Hogwarts' secrets. Walk up close to hear what they say.
Picture2=Picture_21_B
Line3=Collect 75 collector cards and you will win a prize...
Picture3=Picture_21_D
Count=4
